  "description": "Various roof repairs following on from the roof drone survey (those photos and details in attachment)\r\n\r\nScaffolding setup to front and rear of 119 North Hill\r\n\r\nNew front Gully:\r\nRemove existing front gully.\r\nRe-fall timbers towards outlet.\r\nSupply and fit associated flashing details.\r\n\r\nZinc roof covering:\r\nRemove existing zinc roof coverings.\r\nRaise 25 mm for Airflow cold roof system.\r\nReboard and cover with a new zinc system.\r\n\r\nAccess hatch:\r\nRemove rotten door and rotten side frame details.\r\nSupply and fit new timber frame where needed and supply and fit new door.\r\nPaint door with oil based paints.\r\nSupply and fit new door furniture.\r\nInstall weather bars where applicable.\r\n\r\nRepairs:\r\nSupply and fit new rear gutters.\r\nInstall flashings to rear roof.\r\nSupply and fit ventilation to rear flat roof.\r\n\r\nChimney stack works:\r\nRake out and repoint both chimney stacks,\r\nLime based mortar should be used.\r\nReflaunch both chimney stacks, lime based mortar should be used.",
